From: AF9 <af9@localhost>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:12:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fusion reactors: one round ring of 19 blocks for every tier,
 energy hatches optional (7.5.3-af9.15)

- FusionStructure: the ring is now generated as a true circle (channel radius 8, 19 x 19 blocks) instead of GT's octagon-like
  frame stretched to 19 / 23 / 27. Mk1, Mk2 and Mk3 share it. Same parts as before: a 3 layer tube (air channel, casing above
  and below, glass / casing walls), four coils on the inner wall, fluid import hatches (top and bottom) and export hatches
  around the four poles, the controller on the outer wall at the south pole.
- The structure no longer requires an energy hatch: the 'E' blocks are casing or an energy hatch (8 spots on the outer wall).
  The reactor still needs power from a hatch to build its field and run a reaction.
- Ring render and preview follow the new size; new tooltip line about the optional hatches.
